                                "sense_id": "2371ef63-b669-3fc4-bf85-f98dd3beb235",
                                "text": "MULTURE, n. [L. molitura.] 1. In Scottish law, the toll or emolument given to the proprietor of a mill for grinding corn. 2. A grist or grinding."
